          "sentences": 2,
          "questions": 0,
          "firstAudioMs": 903,
          "mentioned": false
        },
        {
          "turn": 5,
          "kind": "followup",
          "text": "它陪您十二年，这份情意哪是“一只猫”能说清的呀。",
